### Roles and permissions (ROLE_READ / ROLE_EDIT)
@host = http://localhost:8080
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Every role of my company, with how many users hold it
GET {{host}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Permission catalog for the role editor (grouped by page)
GET {{host}}/api/roles/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One role
GET {{host}}/api/roles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a role of my own (max 10 per company)
POST {{host}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sotuv menejeri",
  "description": "Kampaniya va kontaktlar, sozlamalarsiz",
  "permissions": ["DASHBOARD_READ", "CAMPAIGN_READ", "CAMPAIGN_EDIT", "CONTACT_READ", "CONTACT_EDIT", "REPORT_READ"]
}

### Update it — everyone holding this role is logged out
PUT {{host}}/api/roles/6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sotuv menejeri",
  "description": "Jonli monitoring ham qo'shildi",
  "permissions": ["DASHBOARD_READ", "CAMPAIGN_READ", "CAMPAIGN_EDIT", "CONTACT_READ", "CONTACT_EDIT", "REPORT_READ", "LIVE_READ"]
}

### Delete it (409 while any user still holds it)
DELETE {{host}}/api/roles/6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
